{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"apps/clax_app/test/support/fake_core.dart","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-20T06:00:57.101455Z","id":"e9cc872f7dd32a5facde784775e9084965c2529e70015e462a9c91ad8d13ff6f","body":{"detail":"The routes: GET/POST /api/artifacts, GET /api/artifacts/{aid}, POST /api/artifacts/{aid}/versions, POST /api/sessions, GET /api/sessions/{sid}/feedback, POST .../feedback/ack, POST .../threads/{tid}/comments, POST .../docs:batch, POST /api/stream/{id}. A test of HttpClaxApi over CoreTransport that reaches another route (drafts, questions, inbox, grants, files, thread actions) needs its route and JSON encoder added here; pollFeedback's late answers (QuestionView) are not encoded and throw UnimplementedError at line 181.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":133},"end":{"line":215},"content_hash":"3fbcbe754cee8c4679633731065b7383e898453ea7f2afdc1a4a8fded13a760f"},"summary":"FakeCore.fromApi answers ten of HttpClaxApi's routes; every other path answers 404 not_in_fake, and late question answers throw","tags":["session:claude-code:e697d918-f48a-41f9-aac4-4be74128e8ae"]}}
